graph TD
    Start([Admin logs in]) --> NavCheck{is_admin?}
    NavCheck -->|No| Hidden[Admin link hidden]
    NavCheck -->|Yes| ShowNav[Admin link visible in sidebar]

    ShowNav --> ClickAdmin[Click Admin link]
    ClickAdmin --> AdminRoute{AdminRoute guard}
    AdminRoute -->|Not admin| Redirect[Redirect to /]
    AdminRoute -->|Admin| LoadPanel[Load AdminPanel]

    LoadPanel --> UsersTab[Users Tab - default]
    LoadPanel --> DashTab[Dashboard Tab]

    UsersTab --> ViewTable[View user table with balances]
    ViewTable --> ClickAdjust[Click Adjust Credits on user]
    ClickAdjust --> EnterAmount[Enter amount + reason]
    EnterAmount --> Apply[Click Apply]
    Apply --> PatchAPI[PATCH /admin/users/id/credits]
    PatchAPI --> RefreshList[Refresh user list]

    DashTab --> ViewKPIs[View 8 KPI cards]
    ViewKPIs --> Stats[Total users, credits, scans, etc.]
